    lockdep: Introduce lock_sync()
    =

    There are some points where we want to annotate as a wait point for a
    lock, so that we can catch the deadlock case like:
    =

            Task 1                          Task 2
    =

            lock(&A);
    =

            <wait for B to release>
    =

